  "description": "This Design, Access supports a revised planning application for the installation of two air \nconditioning condenser units at roof level serving Flat 3 at 81 Duke Street. The application \naddresses the reasons for refusal of the previous proposal and presents an amended scheme \nthat significantly reduces visual and heritage impact. \nThe new proposal positions the condensers side-by-side in a low-profile arrangement, \nconcealed from view behind the chimney stack. Planting will be introduced around the units \nto further reduce visibility. The revised scheme is discreet and does not result in visual harm or \nmaterial alteration to the historic fabric.",
